00:43:00.950 --> 00:43:03.800
for Python for us as well.
But a lot of the stuff

00:43:05.300 --> 00:43:09.830
now, we have a huge SAS
infrastructure. And now we also

00:43:09.830 --> 00:43:11.870
build a huge R infrastructure.

00:43:11.870 --> 00:43:14.030
And now when we're
starting up with Python,

00:43:15.710 --> 00:43:17.660
you have the
